{"synopsis":"Ada seorang prajurit tanpa nama yang mengabdikan hidupnya untuk menjaga dan melayani Cheon Mu-ryang, putra sulung Klan Cheon.\n\nPada akhirnya, ia dikhianati oleh Cheon Mu-ryang dan menemui kematiannya.\n\nNamun ketika ia membuka matanya kembali, ia mendapati dirinya terlahir kembali sebagai orang yang membunuhnya: Cheon Mu-ryang, si anjing gila yang terkenal dan putra sulung Klan Cheon.\n\nDengan ingatan masa lalunya, kemampuan bela dirinya, dan penilaian yang dingin dan penuh perhitungan, ia mengenakan topeng seorang penjahat dan terjun ke dalam perebutan kekuasaan internal klan.\n\nDari dalam, ia mulai menyelamatkan Klan Cheon dari kehancuran…\n\nUntuk menulis ulang masa depan itu sendiri.","alternative_title":"천씨세가의 망나니가 되었다","author":"Baekmong","artist":"Gorou","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"664b1f41-c539-4461-b042-c9316746e4e5","number":"17","chapter":"17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ec482fc3-7883-4f3a-a861-cfc21aed2401","number":"16","chapter":"16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-05-04","released":"2026-05-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"9e8b7a4e-8108-4114-98c8-5b12cc6002f4","number":"15","chapter":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-04-27","released":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"72eed142-d6d1-4922-9a60-30f8d01340b6","number":"14","chapter":"14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-04-17","released":"2026-04-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2d99d4dd-7441-42b5-8c3f-5dff9699670c","number":"13","chapter":"13","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-03-31","released":"2026-03-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"44778db6-7ccb-48fa-b22a-6feed8aad709","number":"12","chapter":"12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-03-18","released":"2026-03-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"713635f8-f3d5-47fe-a0f2-c40ce0e7a943","number":"11","chapter":"11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-03-11","released":"2026-03-11","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e4e05dbc-cf85-4f5b-b3c1-62babbcabdf1","number":"10","chapter":"